          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{x}&=4\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{5}\\\\\\sqrt{x}&=2\\sqrt{5}\\\\x&=(2\\sqrt{5})^2\\\\x&=20\\end{align*}$$",
